      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwimbili wami nakeŋa kamina kawami nakeŋa kakutena itempadindi danyivinyu. Wami nakeŋa wadiŋi netempa dindi kumpidiyasweja wushi nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wapundiluku kembila kwi-ndo, wakuŋwilumu malola adiŋumu, watumbilumu muvinyu wakutonda chakutonda, mukachikadu hakutuŋilamu kaposhi, hakupokolamu muwukamwinu wavinyu. Hakutalila nindi dakasoŋi nyikabu yavinyu, hidikusoŋa nyikabu yavinyu yamwisaŋa yalula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu enu mwashakama muYerusalema, ninenu antu amuYuda, nsompelenu mwani, muloŋa wami netempa dami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu mwitempadami mwashala kwila chumanyi chinabuli kwila? Ami nadiŋi nakutalilanami dinsoŋeli nyikabu yavinyu, hidikunsoŋela nyikabu yavinyu yamwisaŋayalula muloŋanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leka niyileji chinakela itempa dami; nakafumishaku ikoli diduku, akadidya tuhu kwawu. Nakasandola chipaka chiduku, akadidatola kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakadisandasanda ndu-ndu, hiyakakunkula kunkulamu nyitayi yanyivinyu hela kusaŋulamuku, mwakamena kwayikwata nanyiŋa. Nakaleja nimavu akabuli kunokeshahu nvula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋatempa danyivinyu daYehova wamazaza wowu mutaŋa waIsarela, mutonduwindi watiyayi kuwaha wowu antu amuYuda. Watalilili kusompesha, komana hikudi kukabisha. Watalilili kuloŋa, komana hikudi ikumbudakudila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, abulakeshaŋa itala netala, asumbwaŋeshaŋa iha neha chakadininaha hakushala, mwaka ayishakamishi kanka wenu hohu mukachi ketuŋa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, amenekeshaŋa budidi kulonda akanwi walwa; ashakamaŋa shakame-e nimukachi kawufuku nichicha kushetawu vinyu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyawŋa yawu kwekala nitudada, niyisanji, nindimba, nimahululu, nivinyu; ilaŋa awena kutala mudimu waYehova nehi, hela yelaŋa makasindi kuyishinshika chachiwahi nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hanafumi antu ami kuya muwudunu, hohakubula kwiluka; niantu awu alema hiyakufwa nzala, niluntu lwawu lwaluvulu hilukúuminina madimi nampwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hanafumi kaluŋa kutohesha mupwepu windi, hakwasama nimukanwa kindi chakadi kwesekeja; niwutotombuwawu, niluntu lwawu, nikuyuŋa ana kwawu, nimuntu wadisamaŋa amukachi kawu, hiyakukunkumukilamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakadi kulema hakubandama, muntu walema hiyakumuzozesha, mesu amukwa kudi mujola hiyakuyihombesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa aYehova wamazaza hakutoha kukusompesha, Nzambi mukwakujila hakujilikewa kukuloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu anyana kanyikoku akadya neyi hikuwudiilu wawu, nimahembi awantu atoha nyijimba akayidyakudi akwakuki mbakimba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, awa akokaŋa kuluwa nanyonji yamaswimbu! Akokaŋa nshidineyi nalumwonji lwetemba!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahoshaŋa nawu, Anyakali kwindi, ahindeshi mudimu windi kulonda tuwumoni; maana alejaŋa ayi Wajila waIsarela akundami kwakwihi, enzi, kulonda tuyiluki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, awa akutena yatama nawu yayiwahi, yayiwahi nawu yatama; abalumunaŋa mwidima nawu chejeji, chejeji nawu mwidima; abalumunaŋa ayalula nawu yatowala, yatowala nawu yalula!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, awa adimonaŋa nawu, Tukweti maana; adimonaŋa nawu, wababala!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, awa ayilobu yakunwa vinyu, amayala akweti Ŋovu yakwemawalwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayiŋashaŋa akwakwila chatama namaseleka, afumishaŋa kuloŋa kwamuntu waloŋa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, chanoŋaŋa antotu nedimi dakesi, chakamaŋa amatahu awuma namulaŋu wakesi, dichi chakela ninyiji yawu yakelaneyi chuma chatoka, ninkenu jawu jakakakumuka neyi lunkuŋu; nanochu chanalekuwu nshimbi jaYehova wamazaza, nichanadiwuluwu izu daWajila waIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chineli kuzuwa kwaYehova hikukuyibutukila antu indi, hakuyolwelani chikasa chindi, hakuyeta, mpidi janyanya hijikuzaala, niyibimbiyawu hiyikwikala neyi nswadi yananatuwu kunyikwakwa yamunyikala. Hela anamoni yejimiyi, kuzuwa kwindi kuhita nehi, chikasa chindi saŋa acholwelayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
