        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yidi kwakulehi wakayinyamwina mpandelu, wakemba muloji wakuyitambika kunsa yeseki kwaduwu; enza nikwinza, nakukumpa lufuchilwalweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
