          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsewu jawu jatwa, mata awuanyikunji ejima akwevula dehi; yikwa yatuwalu twawu akayifuukula neyimalola, tufumbu twawu neyi chinjimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.28",
